 "words": 181,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Born in the dark, I sat by the road",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Begging for coins with a heavy load",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spat on the ground and he made some clay",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He put it on my eyes and he said, go wash it away",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I went to the pool and I washed my face",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And light came pouring into that place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The neighbors asked, isn't this the beggar man",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The leaders asked me who and how, they did not understand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whether he is a sinner I do not know",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One thing I do know",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I was blind, and now I see",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I was blind, and now I see",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They questioned my mother, they questioned me twice",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They wanted an answer to fit their device",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But all I can tell you is what he has done",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He opened my eyes and I'm seeing the sun",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whether he is a sinner I do not know",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One thing I do know",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I was blind, and now I see",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I was blind, and now I see",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the light of the world",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
